# SENTINEL-X ACL MQTT
# ESP8266 node
user sentinel-node-01
topic write sentinel/sentinel-node-01/telemetry
topic write sentinel/sentinel-node-01/alerts
topic write sentinel/sentinel-node-01/status
topic read sentinel/sentinel-node-01/cmd

# API backend
user sentinel-api
topic read sentinel/#
topic write sentinel/+/cmd
topic write sentinel/config/#
topic read $SYS/#

# ML anomaly service
user sentinel-ml
topic read sentinel/+/telemetry
topic read sentinel/config/#
topic write sentinel/ai/alerts
topic write sentinel/+/cmd
topic write sentinel/ai/#

# Lecture seule dashboard (optionnel)
user dashboard-ro
topic read sentinel/#
